            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Adelinde",
            "text": "It's been a long time since I last saw Masters Diluc and Kaeya sharing a meal together. The atmosphere was... ahem, was not something that a maid of my lowly stature should be commenting on.",
            "nextDialogs": [
